{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥，結束了？」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3452", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "班會結束後，櫻乃像平常那樣來到我的教室。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，正好結束了。」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「時機好準。」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3453", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「兄妹……交……真的……傳聞……嗎？」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "混在喧鬧聲中，「聲音」又出現了。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那是沒有意識、注意到的話就聽不到的……聲音。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥？」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3454", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……沒什麼。」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "櫻乃好像聽不到。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過……為什麼？", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瀨名同學，謝謝妳每天都陪我們。」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一起用功就感覺時間過得特別快。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "表示這段時間非常充實吧。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我是無所謂……」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5594", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔不在很寂寞？」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3455", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊。她其實也不是腦袋不好，教起來有成就感。」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5595", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿……那如果一直被瀨名同學教學，她就能進步到很棒的分數吧？」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊。不過安潔的目的是為了尋找自己服侍的主人。」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5596", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「定下目標的人很厲害呢。」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊。像我就只是漫無目的的念書而已。」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5597b", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣還能考出那麼好的成績也很厲害啊……」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學用苦笑回應我的話。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為不滿足於現狀，所以才會前進吧。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃呢？」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5597", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我的目的？」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3456", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對，沒有聽妳說過呢。」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5598", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「跟葛格在一起。」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3457", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……抱歉，我不該問的。」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5599", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「葛格呢？」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3458", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我？我也是跟櫻乃在一起喔。」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「為了這個目標，我要盡可能努力才行。」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，所以現在是用功準備考試。」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3459", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5600", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學看著我們。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瀨名同學，有什麼想問的嗎？」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有。你們兩人，真的只有用功而已呢。」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5601", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「現在是考試期間喔？」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3460", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是那樣沒錯，但我以為……」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5602", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學臉紅了。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「會是更……甜蜜的氣氛。」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5603", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「跟葛格在一起，每天都甜甜蜜蜜。但是，這就跟以前一樣。」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3461", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「跟以前一樣……啊，嗯，也是呢。交往就是那樣吧。」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5604", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃，不要隨口亂說。」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？不是嗎？」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5605", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為我們在一起的時間很長了。所以比起戀人，兄妹的感覺更強一點喔。」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然我在等進入親親熱熱狀態的機會，但是遲遲沒有到來。」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3462", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我都不知道妳在等那種事啊。」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼為了不要妨礙機會出現，我差不多該回去了呢。」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5606", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「晚飯呢？不一起吃嗎？」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3463", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天久米超市好像有時間限定的特賣。」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5607", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「忘記了。」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3464", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣啊。」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「報紙裡有夾傳單，愛理說的對，有時間限定的特賣。」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3465", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這是報紙裡夾的傳單。」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3466", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我沒有訂報紙。居然有一人限購一個的商品！」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5608", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學瞥了我一眼。", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳願意的話，一起去吧？」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃，可以嗎？」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5609", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「當然。」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3467", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝你們，太好了。」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5610", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為買到了所有預定要買的東西，瀨名同學一臉滿足的表情。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這種小事，隨時都可以。」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。果然跟愛理一起購物時，活力不一樣。」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3468", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是、是那樣嗎？」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5611", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好像奔馳在戰場的狼，或者鎖定獵物的鷹一樣。」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3469", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這種程度很普通吧，普通。」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5612", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……是啊。」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "還是不要多說什麼好了。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生君，如果有話想說，就清楚地說出來比較好喔？」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5613", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個……」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔，你們三人來買東西啊？」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": "ht1159", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸，隼太。」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「陪愛理來特賣。」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3470", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿，這樣啊。」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": "ht1160", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對，就是這樣。」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5614", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「隼太呢？」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為醬油沒有了，所以就被派來跑腿。」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": "ht1161", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「原來如此。」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是說，你們用功到這個時間嗎？」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": "ht1162", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對。」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3471", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真厲害啊。我也來加油一下不要輸給你們。」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": "ht1163", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「考試明天就結束了吧？」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是沒錯啦。」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": "ht1164", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他苦笑聳了聳肩。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，不好意思跟你聊這麼久。」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也對，老媽會念我的。」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": "ht1165", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那明天見啦。」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明天見，瀨名同學和小櫻乃也是。」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": "ht1166", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明天見。」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5615", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「現在的話，或許還來得及特賣。」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3472", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈，這樣啊，我會努力看看。」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": "ht1167", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太朝我們揮手正要離去，不過突然停下了腳步。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，對了新吾。」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": "ht1168", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼？」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「或許是說想太多了……」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": "ht1169", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「暫時不要在學校裡跟小櫻乃兩人獨處比較好喔。」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": "ht1170", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
